{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12311830","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12311830","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1231183001:1":{"text":"我们先来看这座艾雅神像，你会发现祂并没朝向大海。","source_cn":"我们先来看这座艾雅神像，你会发现祂并没朝向大海。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F9404C67650F202","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1231183002:1":{"text":"这是因为女神无需注视大海，祂庇佑着的，是我们锈锚港。","source_cn":"这是因为女神无需注视大海，祂庇佑着的，是我们锈锚港。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7AB63FAFB2113D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1231183003:1":{"text":"好，接下来把目光移向广场，你们会发现这座广场是由三艘船形拼凑！","source_cn":"好，接下来把目光移向广场，你们会发现这座广场是由三艘船...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28F7FE8C7258A6EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1231183004:1":{"text":"这就是锈锚港以水运和航道出名的标志性建筑风格，舰型眺望台！","source_cn":"这就是锈锚港以水运和航道出名的标志性建筑风格，舰型眺望台！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71EC9CF926FFD4C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欢乐的普鲁库":{"text":"欢乐的普鲁库","source":"欢乐的普鲁库","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}